# Docs from source

API reference is generated from docstrings and doc comments, never written by
hand. `docs/build.sh` compiles every language into one site and fails on any
undocumented public symbol or docs warning.

Any change to public code, doc comments, or the docs build follows the
`source-docs` skill, and the PR runs `docs/build.sh`. The first code in a repo,
and the first file in each new language, add that language to the build in the
same PR.
